The following components were ported from C to Rust:

  - The USB HID protocol structures and wire formats
    (originally in: libroccatnyth/nyth_*.c, nyth_*.h)

  - Device enumeration and hidraw ioctl communication
    (originally in: libroccat/roccat_device_hidraw.c)

  - SpecialReport event parsing and handler dispatch
    (originally in: libnytheventhandler/nyth_eventhandler.c)

  - Button type definitions, HID keycode mappings, and
    profile/settings/button data structures
    (originally in: libroccat/roccat_button.c, libroccatnyth/nyth.h)

Only the Nyth-specific code from roccat-tools has been carried forward.
All other device support (Kone, Ryos, Tyon, etc.) has been omitted.

